  3.909319398711351*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bbc0a8c0-cd1b-4aa7-804d-\
00a509a83b28"],

Cell["\<\
For rigorous verified rational approximations proofs of some inequalities \
appearing in the text see the end of the script\
\>", "Subtitle",
